# scoring — score increment/decrement, max score, player description, status line, endings

max score: 10
player "You look sharp and ready for adventure."
status score, moves

verb collect
    takes noun
    "Nothing to collect."

verb spend
    takes noun
    "Nothing to spend."

verb seize
    takes noun
    "You can't seize that."

verb quaff
    takes noun
    "Nothing to quaff."

verb study
    takes noun
    "Nothing to study."

room Hall "A grand entrance hall."

    object coin "A gold coin."

        instead of collect:
            score + 5
            say "You collect the coin."

        instead of spend:
            score - 2
            say "You spend the coin."

    object trophy "A gleaming trophy."

        instead of seize:
            score + 10
            win "You claim the trophy and triumph!"

    object poison "A vial of poison."

        instead of quaff:
            score - 5
            fail "The poison takes hold. Everything goes dark."

    object note "A crumpled note."

        instead of study:
            end story "The note reads: nothing matters."

test "default"
    collect coin. "You collect the coin"
    spend coin. "You spend the coin"
    examine me. "You look sharp"

test manual "win"
    seize trophy. "You claim the trophy"

test manual "fail"
    quaff poison. "The poison takes hold"

test manual "end story"
    study note. "nothing matters"
